           -----------------------------------------------------------------
           NODE0 DEVICE_DRIVER  serial.device
           NODE1 DEVICE_DRIVER
           NODE2 DEVICE_DRIVER  baudbanding.device
           NODE3 DEVICE_DRIVER  Gvpio.devices
